NonFiniteCell.description:
One REAL cell whose value JSON cannot carry (an infinity; SQLite turns NaN
into NULL itself). JSON has no such number, so the cell is `null` in `rows`;
this entry says it was not SQL NULL and what it really was.

file_kind_counts.description:
Every `files` row by `file_kind`. `indexed` is the set with content and
structural evidence; `binary` was sampled and deliberately not parsed;
`skipped` was discovered but never read, so it has no content.
